  <book code="TIT" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:50:04 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Titus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Tit</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tit</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt">Tit</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Phao-lô, xapok ku Kơy Plêêk ji adro jah rơơlh ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, vii xuum tuôq ku khơl adro jah Kơy Plêêk rơơlh xok ji varơuq hlolh xet hyioh jăk ta muut dii xuum tuôq kuh kul Lôôk, <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />dii takôô gamưh kajưk dik truh varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy đơu Kơy Plêêk, Kơy leh đnooy pa ôôh, heq tavek xing adroyq tôôy đơơy xanưm. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Bơh muut klip kawat, Kadraq heq kahnoq vlôh apok Kadraq xing varơuq padoh taboon hêêl kaxay đơu gô heq jah pahnăp tyauq apok tanưưl ku Kơy Plêêk, Wơơt Lôôk ku haay. <verse eid="TIT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Atăq ka Tit, koot dik ku gô đom xuum tuôq achung. Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq, ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Wơơt Lôôk ku haay, truh tol koot.<verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Gô heq xôq koot hlê aduq Kơ-rêt vii ka varơuq neq, nưq laa xôq koot e hnoq ralauq palauq kaluh varơuq măn koq payôôch ji ăm dơơp khơl draq lơơk đom tôôy theng đaji gô heq pato jarooy koot — <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />manih nưq pheq leh e aduq đnooy ik, laa kanau ku muuyq kadrê, e koot xau muuyq xuum, leh biq đnooy pahnhiq truh đơơy riirh bơyq ba long lưp tameng tyauq. <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Vii adro xakaq bơy rôp dăt pheq leh e aduq đnooy ik, đaji laa adro jư 'yo hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk, leh katơơk galơh, leh tôq jaraq, leh gien lok, leh tagay tayaat, ji leh hmưch trôôch, <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />xaloah muut đnư laa pheq xung tamooy kadrơy, xung xiaq varơuq kaxay tamaq, khôôt xet, hyioh jăk, vah xarêh, jư xăk, <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />jư kajưk apok plêêk đangq tuôq gamưh ta muut dii jaauq liq, xôq ka manih nưq e da uh paraat xôq vơơ ahluk ahlul khơl drơy bơơn varơuq pato dayq talăng kalh, vơơ ta'meq 'moq khơl tachơơl hlê.<verse eid="TIT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Vii e 'ngưng adro ahluk ka'lăk, hôôk đnooy athêêk katơơk galơh, ji bing aluut pa ôôh, nhưk laa khơl adro thuôk bing goch kađuh. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Varơuq duh dik laa dăt bing oot hnhep huuy. Oot đong tagay xôôl dôôl dêq hloay kaluh kôôch hnhư tuôôy pato kaluh varơuq leh duh pato, vii kơq jêêt baak đangq kamưưl. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Muuyq đom sôôq oot, 'ngưq laa khơl hnhư hlit ku kadih oot, heq đnooy đaneq: “Manih Kơ-rêt hloay laa khơl adro đnooy pa ôôh, kaluh koot ôô xamư, kaluh apoop klaak pakeng vôk alah pôk.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Apok dơơp xanưk neq laa dik. Vii kakơq nưq, dayh toah trek oot kach thier parêq, xôq oot e hnoq jah talăng kalh đom xuum tuôq, <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />leh xôq xuum muut kaluh varơuq taboon leh e ku manih Jo Thaiq long apok pato dayq ku khơl adro wih katoor dii varơuq dik. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Tôôy paroh raay xarêh xaraat ka khơl akơyq xarêh xaraat. Bơh đôôyq dii adro klơơr 'yêq ji lưp tuôq, yôôch be e kajoq xarêh xaraat, đơu kaah xuum biit hloay xuum klaak oot raay heq biq dơơp ka hư hlơơp. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Oot đnooy vlôh oot xet Kơy Plêêk, lunư, đom varơuq dơơp ku oot, oot chôôyq ka'lăk Kadraq, jêêk vlôh đangq ramêq, leh tameng apok, ji leh taxưngq dii paq kê varơuq kaxay tamaq leq.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Bơh koot, dayh đnooy kaluh kajoq laa troq dik dii varơuq pato dayq talăng kalh. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Dayh ahluk ahlul khơl kơy e tuuyh pheq jư xăk, goh gool, xet chưng mưk, talăng kalh đom xuum tuôq, đom xuum xung xiaq, ji đom varơuq atuq xuum. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Kung anưq, dayh ahluk ahlul khơl mo e tuuyh kahnoq vlôh varơuq đangq vado đom kach xa athêêk, leh đnooy xơuq long biq dơơp xapok ka lok, bơh pheq laa manih pato dayq varơuq tolh kaxay, <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />xôq ka oot e hnoq pato dăt khơl mư kadrê blaay jêêk vlôh khơl adro xiaq kanau, xiaq koot, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />xet chưng mưk, xarêh xaraat, wêêt jư 'yo varơuq hnhư ji tameng tyauq kanau mư, xôq apok ku Kơy Plêêk leh biq đnooy katơơk galơh. <verse eid="TIT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Dang anưq, koot dayh ahmưk pato khơl tadăp blaay pheq xet chưng mưk, <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />tuôôy kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk koot đaji tômq ramil truh varơuq kaxay đom tôôy panưh, kaluh varơuq hyioh jăk, katik goh gool đom varơuq pato dayq, <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />dii apok plêêk troq dik leh hnoq vơ đnooy ik, xôq paq kê akơyq xing bing tachơơl pheq biq kamưưl iel vii be e varơuq xơuq leq xôq đnooy truh haay. <verse eid="TIT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Dayh pato khơl xapok pheq tameng tyauq kôôch oot, dơơp hlah xuum kôôch đom tôôy varơuq, bơh leh takaay hlê, <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />leh xa atôk, đơu xaloah muut đnư pheq xanưk kahnoq dêq hloay đangq tuôq gamưh, xôq đom tôôy kach, oot e hnoq xagook hlê apok thơơm ka varơuq pato dayq truh Kơy Plêêk, Wơơt Lôôk haay. <verse eid="TIT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Vii vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk xôq wơơt xok tôôy adro heq jah kahnoq vlôh, <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />juneq đong pato dayq haay, xôq tuôôy heq ka'lăk varơuq lưp kuh kul kung kaluh hmưch trôôch ku dêh araak, haay e hnoq riirh muuyq kach rơơt rol, hyioh jăk ji talăng jăk đom đơơy neq, <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />đong tuôôy takôô xuum takôô gamưh vanong kaxay ji varơuq rama truh tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk yơơt hloay ji Wơơt Lôôk haay laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />Kơy heq pahnăp kadih xăk Kadraq vii haay xôq wơơt root haay klơlh tôôy varơuq xơk tauq ji xôq pa xarêh ka Kadraq muuyq tamooy dong dik, laa tamooy talăng jăk dii varơuq kaxay.<verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Dayh pato kaluh varơuq nưq, ahluk ahlul ji ta'meq pato dii dêq hloay qwuyen da uh. Te xôq akơyq 'yo leh ra kajoq koot.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Dayh panhăk oot tameng tyauq ji dơơp tyauq khơl padrok vuua lôôk kung khơl hnhư adrơk qwuyen, pheq ralauq 'miêh ka tôôy varơuq kaxay, <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />leh đnooy xơuq akơyq, leh tagoa tahmơt, đơu pheq hien tagu, kahnoq vlôh dêq paraat apôôt xăk dii tôôy adro. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Vii haay adroyq neq kung laa khơl adro vlô khưrq ji lưp tameng, biq adô aluut ji dơơp xapok dong đu thưq hmưch trôôch kung xa agưt, riirh đom varơuq xơk tauq ji 'yarơ, đangq geet, ji 'yarơ karưn mamuuyq. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Bơh tuôôy varơuq tolh kaxay ji xuum xung xiaq ku Kơy Plêêk, Wơơt Lôôk haay, jah kahnoq vlôh, <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />yôôych Kadraq wơơt haay, be aalq bơyh kaluh varơuq dơơp vlôh xing varơuq hyioh jăk đơu haay heq dưk dơơp, bơh bơyh xuum biit angơuq ku Kadraq, gamưh varơuq 'nhaau xarêh ku vanong tađôôy đơơu ji varơuq tađôôy đơơu xing Kơy Phool Hiel, <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />laa Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq kahrôq pôôt kach raah jôh tol haay xing Wơơt Lôôk haay laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />xôq atêq tuôôy jah xưng hyioh jăk gamưh vanong plêêk Kadraq, haay jah wih jêêk khơl adro katôôl tyauq đaji xuum takôô gamưh kajưk dik truh varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Apok plêêk neq laa đangq tuôq gamưh, ji gô xung koot đnooy kalh muut kaluh varơuq nưq, aleq ăm khơl akơyq heq tuôq Kơy Plêêk hnoq rơơt rol văch 'yo xôq pahnăp xăk muut varơuq kaxay tamaq. Kaluh varơuq nưq laa tolh kaxay ji e ich ka 'ngưng adro. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Bơh dayh chuh kaluh varơuq takaay tagêh vlô khưrq, kaluh adrơơk nooy, varơuq takaay tayaat ji takhuk tahăk truh ganuun vii kaluh varơuq nưq laa kaluh thưq lưp e ich ji lưp xung liq. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Dayh dơyh ka'lăk adro leq tyauq jiq jaauq atêq muuyq long vaarq yưk ahmưk pato, <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />vii xet đaneq manih đanưq heq biq hyaak hyul ji kưq lôp kadrôôp, laa adro kadih xưh xadrah xăk.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Tuôôy gô patăk A-tê-ma long Ti-chi-kơ truh aduq koot, yôôych koot dayh dayh truh tavơh gô aduq Ni-kô-bô-li, vii gô heq đinq măn hlê xiêk ka oaq aduq nưq. <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Dayh jarooy thơy ganuun Xê-na ji A-bô-lô dưk hooy dik tơơl dal, aleq ăm oot leh thiuq dêq kajoq. <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Khơl oh ay khơl tuôq ku haay kung pheq hok pahnăp xăk muut kaluh varơuq kaxay tamaq dong đu kaluh varơuq duh dik, xôq be wih jêêk leh e găp play.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Dêq hloay khơl adro măn dii gô vôôch hlơq koot. Dayh atăq apok vôôch hlơq khơl adro xung xiaq haay đom xuum tuôq. Apôôy vanong plêêk măn dii dêq hloay oh ay.<verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>